      "value": "@{610d538d5303a82960a415b4|full_name} After I noticed that the app was draining my phone's battery, I decided to charge my phone at 100%, opened the app just for a minute (basically just to make sure the app runs at least once), then closed it again, and also close it from the overview screen. Once my phone reached 38%, I took the above screenshot.\n\nSo after closing the app, the app keeps running in the background, which makes sense since we can still get VRC notifications even if the app is closed, but 30% battery usage seems excessive.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
