      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Hello,\n\nI recently got a new phone that runs on Android 14, Sony Xperia I VI.\n\nOn my new device, the issue doesn't happen, the app doesn't drain any battery when closed (less than 1%, based on the \"battery usage\" page).\n\nSo I only had that issue on my Asus phone, that ran on Android 11.",
